      "pattern": "……，但是……",
      "explanation_en": "But. 但是 introduces a contrast with what was said in the first part of the sentence.",
      "example_zh": "这个菜很好吃，但是有点儿贵。",
      "example_en": "This dish is delicious, but it is a bit expensive."
    },
